 evil from Robin Finck of Nine Inch Nails.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In the last known city on Earth, people are disappearing in their sleep. Those who remain exist in a crisis of reckless experiments to keep awake. You must navigate depraved death cults, otherworldly forces, and the ever-present horror of The HUSH, to save yourself and those who rely upon you.",
